sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant E as EventBridge
  participant Q as Fulfillment Queue
  participant W as Fulfillment Worker
  participant D as DynamoDB Orders
  participant EB as EventBridge
  participant NQ as Notification Queue
  participant N as Notification Worker
  participant NP as Notification Provider

  E->>Q: order.created.v1
  Q->>W: Deliver message
  W->>D: Conditional write PROCESSED_EVENT and RECEIVED->PROCESSING
  W->>W: Process fulfillment
  W->>D: Conditional update PROCESSING->FULFILLED or REJECTED
  D-->>EB: Terminal event via stream/outbox
  EB->>NQ: order.fulfilled.v1 or order.rejected.v1
  NQ->>N: Deliver message
  N->>D: Record processed event
  N->>NP: Send notification with duplicate suppression key

